WEBVTT

03:10.180 --> 03:14.100
[A Prophet]

03:14.500 --> 03:16.900
[Episode 8]

03:28.000 --> 03:28.800
How is it?

03:29.190 --> 03:30.190
Do I look good

03:30.510 --> 03:31.190
in this?

03:37.030 --> 03:37.750
Whatever.

03:38.240 --> 03:39.840
You're not the groom anyway.

03:42.030 --> 03:44.590
I feel like the outfit needs something.

03:52.040 --> 03:53.300
Does it look familiar?

03:54.240 --> 03:55.590
I had its band resized.

03:55.870 --> 03:56.590
Try it on.

03:57.240 --> 03:58.240
But you've worn

03:59.030 --> 04:00.890
this watch for many years, right?

04:03.050 --> 04:05.050
No matter what happened in the past,

04:05.120 --> 04:06.240
from now on,

04:06.530 --> 04:08.250
every second

04:09.630 --> 04:10.750
belongs to us.

04:17.920 --> 04:18.720
Fair enough.

04:19.310 --> 04:20.600
I suppose it's finally

04:21.430 --> 04:22.690
back where it belongs.

04:23.070 --> 04:24.240
Second Master Qian

04:25.000 --> 04:27.330
isn't really planning to hand
all that money over to you, is he?

04:27.330 --> 04:28.660
How do you know he isn't?

04:29.000 --> 04:30.460
Whether he plans to or not,

04:31.240 --> 04:32.900
that money isn't his anymore.

04:33.360 --> 04:34.290
And it certainly

04:35.870 --> 04:36.950
isn't yours.

04:37.510 --> 04:38.680
So you were never

04:38.800 --> 04:40.680
working with the Qian family

04:41.050 --> 04:42.980
on Feng Siyuan's behalf, were you?

04:43.950 --> 04:45.120
You're catching on.

04:45.360 --> 04:47.420
I know exactly what you're thinking.

04:47.870 --> 04:49.330
Feng Siyuan is just a pawn.

04:49.560 --> 04:50.760
The Tianxiang Sect is the real target.

04:50.760 --> 04:52.630
You want to use one
to bring down the other,

04:52.630 --> 04:53.310
right?

04:56.659 --> 04:58.210
Are you warning me?

04:58.380 --> 05:00.840
I'm telling you that
you're being reckless.

05:02.700 --> 05:04.780
The ledger isn't with Qian Huaiyi.

05:05.800 --> 05:07.660
It's with the Eldest Master Qian.

05:09.920 --> 05:10.950
I'm guessing

05:11.270 --> 05:13.000
you don't even know

05:13.110 --> 05:14.600
what he looks like.

05:15.500 --> 05:17.030
Why are you telling me this?

05:17.950 --> 05:19.410
Let's just say I'm doing it

05:21.790 --> 05:22.710
for this.

05:33.800 --> 05:34.480
Chengming.

05:34.510 --> 05:35.159
Wenxin.

05:35.510 --> 05:36.720
You're so badly injured.

05:36.720 --> 05:37.700
You didn't have to meet me here.

05:37.700 --> 05:39.360
I could have gone to your room.

05:39.670 --> 05:42.270
It's not convenient to talk
with my wife in the room.

05:42.270 --> 05:43.600
I just wanted to ask,

05:44.480 --> 05:45.880
does what you promised me

05:45.950 --> 05:46.950
still stand?

05:47.270 --> 05:48.270
Of course it does.

05:48.870 --> 05:49.600
Don't worry.

05:49.920 --> 05:51.750
I've already spoken to Commander Feng.

05:51.750 --> 05:54.350
You won't have taken
that beating for nothing.

05:54.680 --> 05:55.940
Thank you, Chengming.

05:56.360 --> 05:57.720
But don't worry.

05:57.920 --> 05:58.940
I'll search every inch of the Qian family

05:58.940 --> 05:59.980
if I have to.

06:00.010 --> 06:01.740
I will find that ledger for you.

06:02.070 --> 06:04.000
Thanks for your hard work, Wenxin.

06:05.040 --> 06:05.950
But

06:06.480 --> 06:08.030
why has the Eldest Master Qian

06:08.030 --> 06:09.230
never shown himself?

06:10.120 --> 06:11.720
I've been with the Qian family

06:11.720 --> 06:13.480
for four or five years now.

06:13.750 --> 06:14.720
But I've barely

06:14.720 --> 06:16.230
seen him.

06:16.600 --> 06:19.160
He's very elusive.

06:19.550 --> 06:20.550
Do you know

06:21.430 --> 06:22.550
where he lives?

06:25.430 --> 06:26.240
I do.

09:26.090 --> 09:27.850
Who are you?

09:32.120 --> 09:34.210
Who brought you here?

09:42.170 --> 09:44.570
You're the Eldest Master Qian,
aren't you?

09:48.840 --> 09:50.390
You know me?

09:51.520 --> 09:53.120
Are you looking for me?

09:53.550 --> 09:54.480
Bashen Powder

09:55.190 --> 09:56.880
is made right here.

09:57.350 --> 09:58.650
Don't touch that!

10:09.720 --> 10:10.790
Try it.

10:10.810 --> 10:11.970
No, thanks.

10:16.540 --> 10:18.380
This is good stuff.

10:18.750 --> 10:21.400
You don't know what's good.

10:23.090 --> 10:25.290
Where did you find so many blind people?

10:28.260 --> 10:30.650
I blinded them all.

10:32.880 --> 10:36.070
The more they see of the outside world,

10:36.390 --> 10:37.950
the more tainted their hearts

10:37.950 --> 10:39.360
become.

10:39.720 --> 10:41.320
If their hearts aren't pure,

10:41.720 --> 10:43.390
neither is the medicine

10:43.720 --> 10:45.480
they make.

10:46.270 --> 10:47.750
So they'd better

10:48.110 --> 10:50.300
off without their eyes.

10:51.390 --> 10:52.540
How beautiful.

10:58.550 --> 10:59.440
Brother,

11:00.440 --> 11:01.840
how should I address you?

11:03.190 --> 11:03.760
I-

11:06.000 --> 11:07.440
I'm here to buy medicine.

11:08.110 --> 11:10.320
You're here to buy medicine?

11:10.340 --> 11:11.470
Please go upstairs.

11:12.080 --> 11:12.910
After you.

11:34.910 --> 11:35.790
After you.

11:41.640 --> 11:43.040
Why aren't the lights on?

11:44.270 --> 11:45.960
I just heard you say

11:47.600 --> 11:49.080
that Bashen Powder

11:50.540 --> 11:52.490
has even made its way to Nanyang.

11:52.960 --> 11:53.630
Yes.

11:54.360 --> 11:56.360
Domestic merchants went to Nanyang

11:56.670 --> 11:58.070
and spread the word about

11:58.120 --> 11:59.550
its miraculous effects.

12:08.080 --> 12:09.720
Is Nanyang

12:11.540 --> 12:12.700
beautiful?

12:18.470 --> 12:20.870
There's something wrong with this candle.

12:38.320 --> 12:40.250
You're quite smart.

12:40.630 --> 12:41.960
Stay

12:42.390 --> 12:44.550
and make medicine with me.

12:45.090 --> 12:47.090
Look at my candle wicks.

12:47.370 --> 12:50.320
They're all made of top-grade herbs.

12:50.630 --> 12:52.120
Take a sniff,

12:52.280 --> 12:54.360
and it won't hurt in a while.

12:59.600 --> 13:00.530
Someone's here.

13:02.170 --> 13:04.770
Someone wants to kill
your brother and sister.

13:14.430 --> 13:16.100
As long as I'm here,

13:16.360 --> 13:19.320
no one lays a hand on them.

13:20.090 --> 13:21.690
Brother!

13:22.030 --> 13:22.840
Brother!

13:22.840 --> 13:23.750
Save me!

13:23.960 --> 13:25.080
Save me!

13:41.020 --> 13:43.810
Who wants to kill my brother and sister?

13:48.260 --> 13:49.190
Tianxiang Sect.

13:50.630 --> 13:51.930
How do you know?

13:52.570 --> 13:54.690
Your sister just killed someone
from Tianxiang Sect.

13:54.690 --> 13:56.550
And your brother has been secretly

13:56.550 --> 13:58.280
smuggling opium with Blind Du.

13:58.360 --> 13:59.080
Tell me,

13:59.390 --> 14:00.920
if you were the Sect Master,

14:01.830 --> 14:03.160
would you let them go?

14:03.910 --> 14:05.710
You're not here to buy medicine.

14:08.080 --> 14:09.910
What exactly do you want?

14:10.570 --> 14:12.140
I'm here to save you.

14:20.240 --> 14:22.270
I'm an old man

14:22.960 --> 14:24.670
who's lived long enough.

14:25.920 --> 14:27.920
What about your brother and sister?

14:30.550 --> 14:33.150
What's your connection
to the Tianxiang Sect?

14:38.120 --> 14:38.870
They

14:41.030 --> 14:42.950
killed my brother and sister.

14:44.760 --> 14:46.330
How did they die?

14:47.590 --> 14:49.320
They were poisoned by medicine

14:51.570 --> 14:52.770
from the Qian family.

14:55.080 --> 14:56.680
For generations, our family

14:57.840 --> 14:59.550
has practiced medicine

15:01.150 --> 15:02.150
and made remedies

15:02.680 --> 15:04.400
to heal people.

15:04.420 --> 15:08.020
Then why is it that every time
the Tianxiang Sect sets someone up,

15:09.420 --> 15:10.930
the medicine comes from the Qian family?

15:10.930 --> 15:11.990
That's because...

15:12.150 --> 15:13.550
Because

15:15.480 --> 15:17.870
we had nowhere

15:18.670 --> 15:20.630
to hide!

15:22.080 --> 15:23.430
If I hadn't agreed to them

15:23.430 --> 15:25.430
back then,

15:25.890 --> 15:29.560
my brother and sister
would have been the ones poisoned.

15:30.870 --> 15:32.470
My father was

15:33.410 --> 15:36.720
drowned alive by them back then.

15:37.270 --> 15:39.030
If I hadn't agreed,

15:39.480 --> 15:41.670
my brother and sister would have suffered

15:41.670 --> 15:43.390
an even worse fate.

15:44.630 --> 15:45.750
Sect Master is a devil

15:45.750 --> 15:48.320
who'd eat you alive
without a second thought.

15:49.200 --> 15:51.200
If I ever cross paths with him again,

15:51.240 --> 15:53.640
I'll risk my life

15:54.090 --> 15:56.780
to drag him straight to hell with me!

16:01.310 --> 16:02.280
Sect Master!

16:03.120 --> 16:05.010
Sect Master, I didn't say anything!

16:05.010 --> 16:07.770
Sect Master, I didn't say anything!

16:08.240 --> 16:10.150
They're here.

16:10.910 --> 16:11.750
Who?

16:12.870 --> 16:13.510
The trees

16:14.030 --> 16:15.550
are full of their men.

16:15.910 --> 16:16.790
They are here!

16:16.790 --> 16:17.720
We're doomed!

16:17.720 --> 16:18.390
Snap out of it.

16:18.390 --> 16:19.870
You can't save anyone,

16:19.900 --> 16:22.430
just like I couldn't save
my father back then!

16:24.600 --> 16:27.330
Do you want to save
your brother and sister or not?

16:36.880 --> 16:38.240
I'll show you a way out.

16:42.630 --> 16:43.480
What way?

16:44.360 --> 16:46.160
Cooperate with Commander Feng.

16:47.510 --> 16:48.670
What do you mean?

16:49.200 --> 16:51.960
Commander Feng
wants your family's Bashen Powder.

16:51.960 --> 16:53.020
Give me the ledger.

16:53.380 --> 16:54.380
From now on,

16:54.900 --> 16:56.540
we're in this together.

16:57.140 --> 16:58.730
Can Commander Feng

16:59.590 --> 17:01.510
keep our whole family safe?

17:01.530 --> 17:02.660
In times like these,

17:02.750 --> 17:05.079
what could protect us better than an army?

17:05.400 --> 17:06.750
Think about Longxuya.

17:10.349 --> 17:11.240
Okay.

17:11.920 --> 17:13.270
I agree.

17:13.750 --> 17:14.810
Come get the ledger

17:16.400 --> 17:18.319
tomorrow.

17:25.440 --> 17:26.900
I've been waiting for you.

17:27.880 --> 17:28.590
Come in.

17:30.240 --> 17:31.070
Master,

17:34.640 --> 17:36.550
this is our local specialty, Liubao tea.

17:36.550 --> 17:37.400
Please try it.

17:38.120 --> 17:38.780
Have a seat.

17:45.620 --> 17:46.340
I won't sit.

17:46.370 --> 17:47.610
I'll make it short.

17:48.200 --> 17:48.830
Master,

17:49.550 --> 17:50.270
well,

17:50.810 --> 17:52.440
I took that beating

17:53.030 --> 17:55.030
with my wife watching from the side.

17:55.310 --> 17:56.640
I'm not asking for much.

17:56.680 --> 17:57.590
I just want to know

17:57.590 --> 17:59.860
when I can finally hold my head high

17:59.880 --> 18:01.600
in front of their family,

18:01.880 --> 18:03.990
instead of having to
answer to them all the time.

18:03.990 --> 18:05.710
Is that really too much to ask?

18:16.880 --> 18:18.190
From your features,

18:18.440 --> 18:21.120
I'd say that even if you're not destined
for great wealth and status,

18:21.120 --> 18:22.780
you're meant to have a fulfilling life

18:22.780 --> 18:25.630
and a happy family.

18:25.830 --> 18:27.550
Master, don't just look at my face.

18:27.550 --> 18:28.510
Take a look at my butt.

18:28.510 --> 18:29.840
Look what they did to me.

18:29.850 --> 18:30.960
You are a mortal.

18:31.200 --> 18:32.360
All you can see

18:32.570 --> 18:34.810
is the whip on your own butt.

18:35.030 --> 18:36.360
But I can see

18:36.390 --> 18:38.000
what's really weighing you down,

18:38.000 --> 18:39.730
keeping you from your destiny.

18:41.240 --> 18:43.030
It's a doomed relationship.

18:46.240 --> 18:49.570
Master, where would our family
have a doomed relationship?

18:49.710 --> 18:50.390
Sorry,

18:50.480 --> 18:51.610
I've said too much.

18:53.600 --> 18:55.960
Master, please give me some more hints.

18:56.590 --> 18:58.440
Drink your tea.

18:58.460 --> 18:59.190
Master,

19:00.070 --> 19:02.530
this doomed relationship you mentioned...

19:02.640 --> 19:04.950
You mean my wife, don't you?

19:05.440 --> 19:06.640
I didn't say that.

19:07.310 --> 19:08.110
I understand.

19:08.110 --> 19:08.910
I understand.

19:09.910 --> 19:10.700
Master,

19:11.140 --> 19:12.730
how can I break this curse?

19:23.200 --> 19:24.550
I've seen that

19:25.560 --> 19:27.490
your true match is still out there.

19:27.650 --> 19:28.960
I can't promise

19:29.160 --> 19:31.160
she'll make you rich or successful,

19:31.550 --> 19:33.960
but compared to the life
you're living now,

19:34.400 --> 19:36.590
it'll be a world of difference.

19:42.070 --> 19:43.600
She'll be a wonderful match

19:44.270 --> 19:46.590
for you.

19:46.960 --> 19:48.270
It's just that your love life

19:48.270 --> 19:50.070
has been full of twists and turns,

19:50.070 --> 19:52.130
with one mistake leading to another.

19:53.550 --> 19:54.810
Her name has something

19:55.310 --> 19:56.770
to do with a flower, right?

19:57.440 --> 19:58.400
Yes, Master.

19:58.680 --> 19:59.280
Her name is

20:00.310 --> 20:01.310
Bai Wenlan.

20:03.790 --> 20:04.680
I see that

20:04.950 --> 20:06.800
she is right by your side now.

20:08.030 --> 20:08.830
Impossible.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.590
She left with someone else
a long time ago.

20:10.590 --> 20:11.960
She can't be by my side.

20:25.350 --> 20:26.830
When you don't know which way to turn,

20:26.830 --> 20:28.160
ask the spring breeze.

20:28.400 --> 20:29.660
But the spring breeze gives no answer.

20:29.660 --> 20:31.680
So perhaps you should simply
follow your heart.

20:31.680 --> 20:34.100
Since ancient times,
passion has only left empty regrets.

20:34.100 --> 20:35.730
I wonder

20:36.340 --> 20:38.030
if it was the wind that
made the flowers fall,

20:38.030 --> 20:39.000
or

20:40.020 --> 20:42.420
if the flowers were ready to
fall all along?

20:51.480 --> 20:54.760
The spring breeze has its own sorrows.

20:55.400 --> 20:58.800
Don't trouble the spring breeze
to worry for me.

21:49.310 --> 21:50.640
What's with this taste?

21:52.120 --> 21:53.430
They say wine gets better with age.

21:53.430 --> 21:55.830
How come this one's
only getting more sour?

21:56.080 --> 21:57.810
I'm not drinking this anymore.

22:03.350 --> 22:05.590
How did the rain start all of a sudden?

22:06.200 --> 22:08.000
I just fixed it a few days ago.

22:30.180 --> 22:31.510
What are you doing here?

22:32.390 --> 22:33.990
Let's drink the rainwater

22:34.620 --> 22:36.820
and make a toast to a lifetime together.

22:39.800 --> 22:41.000
You've been wronged.

22:41.680 --> 22:42.570
Marrying you—

22:43.550 --> 22:44.750
I don't feel wronged.

23:07.030 --> 23:08.160
Feeling any better?

23:08.480 --> 23:09.750
The medicine will be ready soon.

23:09.750 --> 23:11.200
I'll brew it for you when we get home.

23:11.200 --> 23:11.750
Okay.

23:13.000 --> 23:14.480
You'll be fine soon.

23:15.160 --> 23:16.000
Don't worry.

23:22.160 --> 23:22.920
Miss Qian.

23:23.070 --> 23:23.880
Mr. Zhou.

23:24.160 --> 23:25.230
thanks to you,

23:25.380 --> 23:26.900
my wife is feeling a bit better.

23:26.900 --> 23:27.530
Thank you.

23:27.650 --> 23:29.050
It's the least I could do.

23:29.400 --> 23:31.550
Could I put this batch of medicine

23:31.670 --> 23:32.600
on my tab for now?

23:33.740 --> 23:35.410
You haven't paid for the last batch.

23:35.410 --> 23:36.370
No more credit.

23:37.140 --> 23:37.970
Why not

23:38.140 --> 23:40.070
pawn the ring your wife is wearing?

23:40.750 --> 23:42.030
I can't pawn this ring.

23:42.030 --> 23:43.440
It's the token of our love.

23:43.440 --> 23:44.620
I can't pawn this ring.

23:44.620 --> 23:46.110
You can't even afford her medicine,

23:46.110 --> 23:47.350
and you're still worried about
tokens of love?

23:47.350 --> 23:48.160
Wang,

23:51.010 --> 23:54.050
Mr. Zhou, you truly have
deep affection for your wife.

23:55.590 --> 23:57.050
But getting her treatment comes first.

23:57.050 --> 23:58.960
You can pay for the medicine next time.

23:58.960 --> 23:59.560
Miss Qian.

24:02.750 --> 24:03.350
Mr. Zhou.

24:03.870 --> 24:05.430
Thank you, Miss Qian.

24:05.920 --> 24:07.120
Thank you, Miss Qian.

24:10.590 --> 24:11.720
Don't worry, Honey.

24:12.030 --> 24:13.090
Our fates are intertwined.

24:13.090 --> 24:14.550
We're bound by the same destiny.

24:14.550 --> 24:16.080
I will definitely cure you.

24:36.640 --> 24:39.610
♪ The lantern waits for one
who won't return ♪

24:39.960 --> 24:43.280
♪ My eyes hide a sorrow beyond words ♪

24:43.410 --> 24:46.540
♪ I ask for too much, then blame fate ♪

24:45.440 --> 24:46.920
May your union bring wealth,

24:46.920 --> 24:49.350
health, and longevity.

24:47.010 --> 24:50.030
♪ One year, one hardship, one fall ♪

24:49.750 --> 24:52.200
May you be blessed with many descendants

24:50.890 --> 24:56.080
♪ My greed burns away who I am ♪

24:52.720 --> 24:55.070
and endless good fortune.

24:55.310 --> 24:56.680
Step over the brazier!

24:57.500 --> 25:03.080
♪ My anger clouds what I hold dear ♪

25:00.750 --> 25:03.000
Thank you.

25:03.000 --> 25:04.240
Mind the steps.

25:04.090 --> 25:10.390
♪ My obsession keeps me
from turning back ♪

25:04.270 --> 25:05.200
Be careful.

25:06.960 --> 25:08.200
Thank you.

25:09.830 --> 25:11.640
Have a few more drinks later.

25:10.470 --> 25:16.430
♪ I keep my heart closed ♪

25:11.640 --> 25:14.030
Congratulations, Second Master.

25:14.030 --> 25:14.960
Thank you.

25:14.960 --> 25:15.920
Congratulations.

25:15.920 --> 25:17.270
Thank you.

25:17.270 --> 25:18.590
Shuyi,

25:19.680 --> 25:21.000
what's going on?

25:21.440 --> 25:22.480
It's your big day,

25:22.590 --> 25:25.450
and you haven't even offered
your brothers a drink.

25:31.680 --> 25:32.270
Huaiyi,

25:32.430 --> 25:33.510
these are my brothers

25:33.510 --> 25:34.830
from my maiden home.

25:35.680 --> 25:36.870
Your brothers from your maiden home?

25:36.870 --> 25:38.070
We've had a place ready
for them all along.

25:38.070 --> 25:38.600
This way.

25:38.640 --> 25:38.970
Come,

25:38.990 --> 25:40.270
let's have our own people sit over here.

25:40.270 --> 25:42.030
Everyone, please take a seat.

25:42.160 --> 25:43.110
Come.

25:43.240 --> 25:44.160
Please sit down.

25:44.160 --> 25:45.090
Take your seats.

25:45.830 --> 25:46.960
Is everyone seated?

25:49.160 --> 25:50.830
Why did you bring so many people?

25:50.830 --> 25:52.830
Just focus on putting on a good show.

25:53.240 --> 25:54.310
Coming.

25:54.960 --> 25:55.680
Second Madam,

25:55.680 --> 25:56.680
this way.

26:04.710 --> 26:06.680
I, the Second Master,
am getting married today.

26:06.680 --> 26:08.280
Have some wedding candy.

26:11.030 --> 26:12.030
Here.

26:14.670 --> 26:15.470
Here you go.

26:20.720 --> 26:21.270
Here.

26:29.880 --> 26:31.680
You heard me coming, didn't you?

26:46.840 --> 26:47.600
Easy, easy.

26:48.440 --> 26:49.270
It's

26:49.540 --> 26:51.060
my wedding day.

26:51.590 --> 26:53.450
I brought you some wedding candy.

27:00.270 --> 27:00.920
Come on

27:02.130 --> 27:03.060
Open your mouth.

27:41.870 --> 27:43.400
She'll be a wonderful match

27:43.730 --> 27:46.100
for you.

27:46.910 --> 27:48.310
It's just that your love life

27:48.310 --> 27:50.110
has been full of twists and turns,

27:50.110 --> 27:52.170
with one mistake leading to another.

28:02.730 --> 28:03.910
The medicine is ready.

28:03.910 --> 28:05.370
Drink the medicine first.

28:16.960 --> 28:18.590
Lie down for a while.

28:26.240 --> 28:27.570
Why are you spacing out?

28:27.640 --> 28:28.720
There are guests over there.

28:28.720 --> 28:29.780
Go entertain them.

28:41.600 --> 28:42.800
Stop playing around.

28:45.200 --> 28:46.030
What is going on?

28:46.030 --> 28:47.230
What's with this guy?

29:04.310 --> 29:05.270
Who is he?

29:05.440 --> 29:07.310
I heard he's a relative
of the Second Madam.

29:07.310 --> 29:09.950
He's from the countryside
and has a terrible temper.

29:09.950 --> 29:12.350
The people at the table
behind you are, too.

29:26.670 --> 29:27.880
The Tianxiang Sect has sent someone.

29:27.880 --> 29:28.850
I need to find the eldest Qian brother.

29:28.850 --> 29:29.370
Wait.

29:30.400 --> 29:32.330
You found the eldest Qian brother?

29:32.400 --> 29:33.370
He has the ledger.

29:33.370 --> 29:34.160
I'll come with you.

29:34.160 --> 29:34.750
No need.

29:35.270 --> 29:36.670
Keep an eye on them for me.

30:07.200 --> 30:08.330
Eldest Master Qian!

30:10.790 --> 30:11.920
Eldest Master Qian!

30:22.480 --> 30:23.270
It's gone.

30:24.440 --> 30:25.070
It's gone.

30:25.750 --> 30:26.720
What's gone?

30:30.270 --> 30:31.330
The ledger is gone.

30:32.720 --> 30:33.480
The ledger!

30:34.440 --> 30:35.200
The ledger!

30:36.350 --> 30:37.550
When did this happen?

30:37.750 --> 30:39.150
When I came back that day,

30:40.310 --> 30:41.510
the ledger was gone.

30:42.400 --> 30:43.160
It was them.

30:43.820 --> 30:44.690
They are here.

30:48.440 --> 30:49.490
Eldest Master Qian,

30:49.490 --> 30:52.790
Second Master and Second Madam asked me
to bring you some wedding candies.

30:52.790 --> 30:53.550
Brother,

30:54.790 --> 30:55.720
have some candy.

30:56.750 --> 30:57.680
Have some candy.

30:59.030 --> 30:59.960
Have some candy.

31:38.110 --> 31:39.030
The guests have arrived.

31:39.030 --> 31:40.830
Why are you here all by yourself?

31:41.070 --> 31:42.920
I got a little tired from working,

31:42.920 --> 31:44.240
so I came up to rest for a bit.

31:44.240 --> 31:45.310
It's normal to be tired.

31:45.310 --> 31:46.910
Hard work builds character.

31:50.270 --> 31:50.800
Darling,

31:51.880 --> 31:53.680
I wanted to run something by you.

31:54.830 --> 31:56.400
If this deal goes through,

31:56.860 --> 31:58.860
could you let me handle the business

31:59.040 --> 32:00.610
with Commander Feng?

32:03.250 --> 32:05.650
Didn't I have the Master
read your fortune?

32:05.790 --> 32:06.400
You're not cut out for

32:06.400 --> 32:08.270
dealing with the outside world.

32:08.880 --> 32:09.830
Just listen to me

32:10.070 --> 32:12.030
and take good care of things at home.

32:12.030 --> 32:13.830
You and I are in this together.

32:14.440 --> 32:15.510
If things are good at home,

32:15.510 --> 32:16.400
I'm good.

32:16.750 --> 32:18.810
And when I'm doing well, you will too.

32:22.550 --> 32:23.880
You are right, Darling.

32:24.350 --> 32:25.810
Does your back still hurt?

32:27.200 --> 32:27.930
Not anymore.

32:28.310 --> 32:29.970
Then go entertain the guests.

32:40.960 --> 32:43.480
It doesn't look good
to walk
with a cane on such a joyous day,

32:43.480 --> 32:44.650
does it?

33:44.000 --> 33:44.680
Shuyi,

33:44.880 --> 33:46.680
I was on fire at the table today.

33:47.000 --> 33:48.330
I cleaned everyone out.

33:50.510 --> 33:52.070
That's your second brother, isn't it?

33:52.070 --> 33:53.000
I've heard

33:53.440 --> 33:54.590
he's a sore loser.

33:54.790 --> 33:55.640
He lost a little money

33:55.640 --> 33:57.240
and flipped the whole table.

33:57.350 --> 33:58.680
Talk about being petty.

33:59.500 --> 34:00.670
My second brother

34:01.110 --> 34:03.160
has been obsessed with money
since he was a kid.

34:03.160 --> 34:04.490
Getting money out of him

34:04.750 --> 34:07.080
is harder than getting blood from a stone.

34:07.750 --> 34:10.150
Remember that fortune teller
we saw last time?

34:10.150 --> 34:12.000
You know I don't usually
believe in that sort of thing,

34:12.000 --> 34:13.110
but this time I do.

34:13.360 --> 34:14.630
Because he said you're good luck

34:14.630 --> 34:15.710
for your husband.

34:16.110 --> 34:18.190
The Qian family wouldn't be
where it is today

34:18.190 --> 34:19.550
without you.

34:19.760 --> 34:22.940
You've only been here a few days,
and you've already figured that out.

34:22.940 --> 34:25.540
I don't know why my third sister
is so stubborn.

34:26.110 --> 34:28.840
She's been going against me
at every turn lately.

34:28.920 --> 34:30.000
I can't blame her.

34:30.800 --> 34:32.060
My eldest brother and I

34:32.230 --> 34:33.360
spoiled her rotten.

34:33.840 --> 34:34.900
By the way, Huaiyi,

34:35.420 --> 34:36.330
didn't you say

34:36.590 --> 34:38.920
our eldest brother was coming
to celebrate with us?

34:38.920 --> 34:40.380
I would have forgotten
if you hadn't mentioned it.

34:40.380 --> 34:41.290
I'd forgotten all about it.

34:41.290 --> 34:42.250
I'll go get him.

34:50.550 --> 34:54.110
Brother!

34:54.670 --> 34:55.840
Brother, wake up!

34:58.030 --> 34:58.760
Silly Liang,

34:59.340 --> 35:00.270
why are you here?

35:00.510 --> 35:01.800
You said you were going to
find the eldest Qian brother.

35:01.800 --> 35:02.550
You never came back,

35:02.550 --> 35:03.590
so I got worried.

35:03.670 --> 35:04.110
Wait,

35:04.320 --> 35:05.550
what happened to you?

35:14.510 --> 35:15.150
It seems

35:16.230 --> 35:17.820
the Tianxiang Sect has made their move.

35:17.820 --> 35:19.740
They took the ledger?

35:20.070 --> 35:21.900
Before he died, Qian Huairen told me

35:21.900 --> 35:23.430
the ledger was already gone

35:23.690 --> 35:25.290
when he returned yesterday.

35:26.550 --> 35:27.150
Brother,

35:27.760 --> 35:29.590
the auspicious hour is approaching.

35:29.590 --> 35:31.120
We're just waiting for you.

35:31.670 --> 35:32.670
What should we do?

35:32.710 --> 35:33.320
Brother!

35:35.510 --> 35:36.190
Brother!

35:38.480 --> 35:39.110
Brother!

35:42.320 --> 35:43.200
Break it down!

35:47.590 --> 35:50.710
Brother!

35:53.200 --> 35:55.280
Brother!

36:29.360 --> 36:30.440
Brother, wake up!

36:31.360 --> 36:33.230
It's Huaijin, brother!

36:34.960 --> 36:36.000
Who did this?

36:37.100 --> 36:38.020
Who did this?

36:38.040 --> 36:39.450
Who did this?

36:46.830 --> 36:48.630
Did you see Shangguan Chengming

36:48.880 --> 36:50.680
in the front courtyard just now?

36:53.110 --> 36:53.970
Second Master!

36:54.590 --> 36:55.450
Second Master!

36:56.910 --> 36:58.510
We've searched everywhere,

36:58.610 --> 37:00.070
but there's no sign of him.

37:09.330 --> 37:10.860
We can't hide here for long.

37:11.710 --> 37:12.440
Silly Liang,

37:12.510 --> 37:13.280
go inside and

37:13.330 --> 37:14.630
find a place to hide down there.

37:14.630 --> 37:15.490
What about you?

37:17.110 --> 37:17.910
I have to go up.

37:18.370 --> 37:19.440
If I go up,

37:19.630 --> 37:21.020
they won't come down here to search.

37:21.020 --> 37:21.480
No.

37:21.840 --> 37:22.750
I'm going with you.

37:22.750 --> 37:24.410
We'll fight them if we have to!

37:24.480 --> 37:25.480
Listen to me.

37:25.820 --> 37:27.100
Go inside and find a place to hide.

37:27.100 --> 37:28.430
No matter what happens,

37:28.920 --> 37:29.780
do not come out.

37:29.800 --> 37:30.480
No!

37:31.440 --> 37:33.030
If you go up there alone, playing the hero
and getting yourself killed,

37:33.030 --> 37:33.920
I could never live with myself,

37:33.920 --> 37:34.900
even if I make it out alive.

37:34.900 --> 37:37.560
Who says I'm going up there
to get myself killed?

37:38.630 --> 37:39.480
Silly Liang,

37:39.650 --> 37:41.710
do you remember what you promised me?

37:49.490 --> 37:50.620
Until we meet again.

38:03.800 --> 38:04.840
It really is you.

38:05.110 --> 38:06.000
It's you.

38:06.400 --> 38:07.760
You killed our brother?

38:09.360 --> 38:09.960
Yes.

38:11.150 --> 38:12.070
I killed him.

38:12.320 --> 38:13.550
Then I'll shoot you right now!

38:13.550 --> 38:15.280
If he didn't die, you all would!

38:16.110 --> 38:17.360
I was saving you.

38:18.400 --> 38:19.330
What do you mean?

38:19.520 --> 38:20.720
It's just one ledger,

38:21.110 --> 38:22.960
yet you've dragged this out for so long.

38:22.960 --> 38:25.090
Commander Feng has lost his patience.

38:26.030 --> 38:27.720
This is your warning.

38:28.510 --> 38:29.150
The ledger

38:29.150 --> 38:31.080
is on its way to Commander Feng now.

38:31.110 --> 38:33.370
You really think you still have a choice?

38:33.400 --> 38:35.590
Then we'll trade our lives for his.

38:35.590 --> 38:36.320
Fine,

38:36.670 --> 38:38.670
then your whole family
will go down with you.

38:38.670 --> 38:40.340
That woman you just brought home,

38:40.340 --> 38:41.760
your sister, your brother-in-law,

38:41.760 --> 38:43.800
and everyone in the Qian family

38:43.800 --> 38:44.840
will die!

38:45.880 --> 38:47.080
Commander Feng's men

38:48.000 --> 38:49.280
will be here soon.

38:52.360 --> 38:53.290
Second Brother.

39:17.550 --> 39:18.710
Tie him up.

39:28.070 --> 39:29.070
For generations,

39:30.510 --> 39:31.710
our Qian family

39:32.920 --> 39:35.250
had been in the herbal medicine business.

39:36.440 --> 39:37.700
We were doing just fine

39:39.920 --> 39:40.920
until

39:43.110 --> 39:46.040
the Tianxiang Sect set their sights
on us unexpectly

39:46.190 --> 39:47.920
and forced us to work with them.

39:48.590 --> 39:50.670
To save my sister and me,

39:51.630 --> 39:52.920
my brother had to agree

39:53.670 --> 39:55.130
to make medicine for them.

39:57.150 --> 39:58.410
But the Tianxiang Sect

40:00.230 --> 40:02.190
only wanted various anesthetics

40:03.190 --> 40:04.070
and poisons.

40:04.880 --> 40:06.740
My brother made medicine for them

40:07.430 --> 40:09.160
and was often forced to test it.

40:09.880 --> 40:11.800
He became

40:11.800 --> 40:13.200
more and more eccentric.

40:13.590 --> 40:15.110
His health broke down

40:15.720 --> 40:17.920
at a young age.

40:19.360 --> 40:20.590
Shangguan Chengming

40:21.510 --> 40:22.400
must die.

40:23.010 --> 40:24.380
If I don't kill him,

40:24.880 --> 40:26.610
my brother won't rest in peace.

40:27.880 --> 40:30.550
Whether it's Commander Feng
or Commander Ma,

40:31.150 --> 40:32.430
they all have to die.

40:38.010 --> 40:40.260
[In the next episode]

40:41.940 --> 40:44.140
Sect Master invites you to watch a play.

40:45.360 --> 40:48.090
I left the mortal world
to practice physiognomy.

40:48.190 --> 40:50.730
Life and death,
I would remain within the sect.

40:50.730 --> 40:52.590
That was the oath your master and I

40:52.780 --> 40:54.410
swore all those years ago.

40:54.680 --> 40:56.070
Once you enter this sect,

40:56.070 --> 40:57.630
there is no turning back.

40:57.660 --> 40:59.210
Greet Sect Master.

41:04.490 --> 41:06.250
Everyone calls you Sect Master.

41:06.250 --> 41:07.240
but are you really worthy of the title?

41:07.240 --> 41:09.440
Everything you do is beneath contempt.

41:10.270 --> 41:12.460
This man is up to no good.

41:12.850 --> 41:14.330
Better take his eyes.
